WEBVTT

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.330
Hey, tell me. What do you think
of age differences in relationships?

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.660
Nothing wrong with it in my opinion.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:19.000
What? But, like, wouldn't a teacher
and a student be too far apart?

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.330
Excuse me, President, but you do
realize this is my room, don't you?

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:29.450
Since you're uneducated,
I'll give you a lesson in science.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:30.830
Okay...

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:36.000
Warmer air rises, and cooler air sinks.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.830
And today, it's crazy hot for May.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:43.540
"Sunohara House"

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:43.540
Our rooms are on the second floor;
yours is on the first.

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.000
That's the situation.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.370
Then why don't you just go to
the kitchen or the living room?!

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:50.830
Don't be so grumpy. You'll go bald, you know!

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.160
What?!

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:54.500
Besides, there's just
something about your bed...

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.120
Hm?

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.700
It smells really nice.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:01.500
For some reason, I feel so embarrassed.

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:34.950
"Elders, Getting Changed, Being a Man"

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:49.410
Now that I think about it, right now,
we're... alone in my room.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.910
I haven't brought it up,
so we've just been casually--

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:54.080
Hm?

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.580
What do you keep looking over here for?

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.790
What? I haven't been...

00:02:58.790 --> 00:02:59.250
Ohh. You're interested in my manga.
You should've said something earlier!

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.950
"Rose-eyed Steroid"
"Hanano Labuko"

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.950
Ohh. You're interested in my manga.
You should've said something earlier!

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:06.080
What are we going to do with you?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:07.540
Well, get over here.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.830
No, I don't really...

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.080
Don't you know to respect your elders?

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.160
But I...

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:14.450
That's a presidential order!

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:16.330
That's kinda authoritarian...

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:18.080
Right now, cadet!

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:21.000
Yes, ma'am. Here I come.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.540
How will you see it if you're
all the way over there?!

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:32.540
Ow! Your head thing hurts!

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.620
Sh-She's in my bubble!

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.450
This makes my arms tired.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:42.500
Huh?

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.250
'Kay!

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.830
I'll just sit here reading,
and you can look at it if you want.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.000
She's bonkers...

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:55.950
Well, this is a problem... Now I'm stuck here...

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.790
Oh, well... Guess I'll do as she says.

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:05.080
It's hard to read like this...

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:09.700
So the President likes <i>shojo</i> manga?

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:13.750
Hm? Recent manga have some
pretty intimate scenes, don't they?

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:18.120
Huh? Why did she stop?

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:24.790
I-I didn't think there'd be a scene like this!

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:29.450
Hm? President?
Aren't you ready to flip the page?

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.540
Ah, ah!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.870
Um, s-sure...

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.950
"Rose-eyed Steroid"

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.540
H-H-H-H-Hold on!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:40.080
Shiina never even registered
as a boy to me, and yet...

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:43.910
Doesn't this look like I'm
enticing him like in the manga?!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:47.870
I'm gonna turn the page, okay?

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.370
D-Don't get any ideas!

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:10.080
I baked some cookies. Have them as a snack!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:13.000
They look great! Thank you very much.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:17.540
I just saw Yuzu- <i>chan</i> run out
of here really fast. What happened?

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:19.660
You know, I have no idea.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:24.910
We were reading this, but the President
just bolted right in the middle.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:24.910
"Rose-eyed Steroid"

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:32.700
Then let's recreate the situation together.
Maybe we'll understand how she felt.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.250
"Recreate"?

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:36.370
How were you reading together?

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:37.910
Um...

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:41.540
Thinking back on it, it's embarrassing...

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.750
The President was, like, between my legs...

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:45.950
Got it!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.790
Don't be shy!

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.200
Read as you please, okay?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.950
O-Okay.

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:58.950
Easy for you to say, but...

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:03.200
I can't concentrate!

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:06.540
I-I get it now! All done!

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:08.250
Really?

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.330
Hey, stop--

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.660
Shiina. I left my--

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.950
Not this again! You two!

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.160
The second I take my eyes off you!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.120
Oh, goodness! Have a cookie!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.120
How do you even get into
such inappropriate positions--

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:21.160
I'll take one!

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:34.540
Is it just my imagination?

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.000
I'm back!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.540
Welcome home!

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:55.160
All day, it's felt like someone's watching me...

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:02.040
Hey, hey, hey, hey.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:06.040
What is it?

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:06.040
What do you mean? This is the bathroom!

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.620
I'm observing you today.

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:15.040
Does this mean the eyes I felt on me
all day were yours, Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> ?

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:20.410
Lately, all the President talks
about is you... I don't get it.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:23.790
I have to know.
What do you have that I don't?

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:28.790
Assist the investigation.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:32.410
Whatever it is, I don't think it's tangible!

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:39.620
Wouldn't it be easier
just to ask the President?

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:43.500
The President is a busy woman.
Remember your station.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.330
I see...

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:50.750
Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> 's weirdness is
totally different from the President's...

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:51.830
Achoo!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:58.000
Don't worry. I won't get in your way.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:03.700
When she said she's observing me,
I didn't think that included my room...

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.660
Uhh... dictionary... dictionary... d--

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:11.660
I can't keep calm!

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:13.160
What's wrong?

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:15.370
You've been moving
awkwardly for a while now.

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.160
Why are you so close?!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:24.160
Y-Yes? What is it?

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.620
This part's wrong.

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.500
Huh? Oh!

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.200
So is this part. And this problem, too.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.080
Are you listening?

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:41.620
S-S-Sorry! You're really smart,
aren't you, Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> ?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:44.750
Of course. I'm on the student council.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.160
Are you mocking me?

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:47.870
We set an example for the other students.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:50.080
"On the student council"...

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.370
Then the President's smart, too?

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.200
Just what do you mean by that?

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.450
Oh, nothing!

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.370
That's right.

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.290
Read this paragraph all the way through.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.540
Oh, I did it!

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:07.750
When you teach it to me,
it all makes sense, and it's even fun!

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:12.700
Wait, what am I doing?

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.000
I'm going to search your room.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.330
Well, I suppose it's less stressful
than having her right next to me.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.660
Whoa!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:29.120
I didn't see anything! I'm not looking!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.450
What's this?

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:35.040
Ah! That was a gift.
I got it before I came here.

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.700
Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> ?

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.620
I, uh, excuse me.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:48.000
Would you happen to like stuff like that?

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:55.000
I guess... It doesn't suit me...
This kind of stuff...

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.000
That's not true at all.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:03.120
Though it's not very manly and
a little embarrassing, I like that stuff, too.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.790
I think it's cute.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:10.540
Th-That's right! Who can help
but like cute things?! It's normal!

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.290
What's going on?
I've never seen her so energetic!

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:16.660
Akkun, here's your laundry!

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.870
My, oh, my! Sorry for interrupting!

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:26.120
It's a misunderstanding!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:30.580
Ms. Ayaka, there's nothing
going on between us.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:34.250
Thank goodness Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i>
is a decent person!

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:37.830
We were just baring
our shameful sides to each other.

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.660
What she just said was outrageous!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:44.290
I see. You let him see, too...

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:46.120
Wasn't that wonderful, Akkun?

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.200
What are you talking about?!

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.620
Uh-huh, uh-huh!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:54.500
Shiina, I think I see why the President
has taken a liking to you.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.330
Uh...

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.200
And if I look closely...

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.500
S-So close!

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:06.160
Hm, don't worry about it.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.910
That's enough for today.

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:09.450
Sorry for bothering you.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:11.290
"For today"?

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:14.500
Not at all. You didn't bother me.

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:17.370
Though I do feel incredibly worn out...

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.080
Oh, right.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:25.040
Better put your books of a shameless
nature out of the President's reach.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.830
I don't have any!

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.910
"Sunohara House"

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:47.160
Yuri, how did Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i>
end up like this?

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:49.000
Well...

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:55.330
We just went to an amusement park.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:58.000
It was so much fun!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.330
Until the incident happened.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.250
There's no gravity to this situation at all!

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:05.790
We're doing that one next!

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:07.540
Um... President, maybe we...

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.370
"Flying Cat Coaster
(No seating)"

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:12.620
"You must be at least this tall to ride."

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:16.330
"140 cm and above"

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.580
Sumire?

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:27.700
It's all my fault! If I hadn't suggested
the amusement park, this wouldn't have...

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.870
I shall atone with my life!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.870
Don't be hasty!

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:34.750
That's basically what happened.

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:37.790
She gets so emotional
where Yuzu's concerned.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:40.370
She's surprisingly fragile, huh?

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:45.870
Ayaka's not here, and she says
she's too ashamed to face us.

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:47.950
Fix it, Shiina.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:54.830
What? But isn't it inappropriate
for a man to enter a lady's room?

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.450
Hm, that is true...

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.450
But it's fine if you're a girl, right?

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:00.290
Well, this doesn't bode well.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:09.000
Again?!

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.790
You look great! Now get going!

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.750
I'm coming in.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:17.910
Who is it?

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:20.000
I-It's Akiko!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.790
What cute taste you have.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:27.450
This is ridiculously embarrassing!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.250
Speaking of cute taste...

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.700
Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> is pretty cute.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:41.040
Her room... It's so feminine!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:42.950
Are you just here to see my room?

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:47.870
Ah, no! Please go back to your usual self!

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:54.660
"Usual self"? Even if I did, I would just
cause trouble for the President anyway.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.910
I can't work up the moti... va...

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.250
If there's something I can do
to help, I'll do it! Anything!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.620
Then help me get changed.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:06.910
What?!

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:30.250
That's so much cooler. It feels nice.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.910
I have pajamas in the second
drawer of that dresser.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:35.620
O-On it!

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:41.450
I can't be here with
Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> in this state.

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:43.410
I have to get her changed quick!

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.370
Huh? She meant this?

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.620
Phew. One less problem.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:01.540
I didn't carry the President on
my shoulders today! I'm in withdrawal!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.660
That's a serious dependence
you've developed!

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:07.790
I can't ask her after what
happened. I'm done for...

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:14.870
Um, could I be a substitute?

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:17.950
Aki, you--

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.540
No... Akiko!

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:34.540
The power is flowing through me!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:40.700
I'm fine now. Sorry for worrying you.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:42.330
I'm glad.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:48.500
So, could you put me down now?

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.250
I just got really embarrassed...

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:54.450
I apologize for worrying you.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:59.250
I'm glad you're better. It'd throw me
off my groove if you stayed like that.

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:06.250
And since I haven't ridden on your
shoulders today, things just don't feel right.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.910
President!

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:12.250
Also, I won't be broken so easily.
Don't underestimate me.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:15.120
I've overcome all the obstacles
in front of me so far...

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:18.040
You know that better than anyone.
You've been with me the whole way, Sumire.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.660
And soooo...

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.120
Let's try again!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.830
Brilliant as always, President!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:28.580
"Flying Cat Coaster
(No seating)"

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.830
"You must be at least this tall to ride."

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:35.500
"140 cm and above"

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:36.910
You can't ride.

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:38.830
President...

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.200
Shiina- <i>kun</i> .

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.410
Shiina- <i>kun</i> .

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:01.790
Wh-Where's that voice coming from?

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:02.870
Right here!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.750
What are you doing, Yuri?

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.250
The truth is, I have a favor to ask you...

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.420
A favor?

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:11.500
Yes.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:15.290
It's something only you can do.

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:19.790
Something only I can do! D-Doesn't this
mean she relies on me as a man?

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:23.120
I'll do it! If it's in my power,
I'll do whatever you ask!

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.120
A man never goes back on his word!

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:30.250
Wonderful! In that case,
let's head straight to my room.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:35.450
Okay! But, um, a man shouldn't
enter a lady's room unaccompanied.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:40.160
Don't worry about that.
Only you can help me with this.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.620
Okay!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:48.290
Please, come in. Sorry it's a little messy.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.870
Pardon my intrusion.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:55.830
Come to think of it, this is the first time
I've been in Yuri's room.

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:57.290
I'm a little nervous.

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:01.870
Did you take this picture here?

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:03.160
Yep!

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:04.700
You all look so young!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.950
I think that's a little rude to say to a lady.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.870
Anyway, about that favor...

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.370
I've been waiting for this!

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:16.660
Whether it's physical labor or bugs--
well that might be tough--Leave it to me!

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.200
I want you to put this on!

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:20.370
What?!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.410
You want me to wear this?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:28.080
U-Um, it seems like lately you've been
wanting to dress me as a girl.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:31.750
I make costumes as a hobby,
and I'd like to see how they fit.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.910
Yuzu is too small,
and Sumire and Ayaka are too big.

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:41.080
See? You're the only one close to my size!

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:43.540
Yes, but aren't these clothes for girls?

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:46.500
You're cute, so it won't be a problem.

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:49.290
Besides, you said you'd
do anything, didn't you?

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.250
Couldn't you try them on--

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:56.790
You said you'd do anything, didn't you?

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:02.910
All right. I'll put it on,
so please just face the other way.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:09.910
My sister also made me do this a lot...

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:15.410
And there's no way Yuri's chest
would fit in my size...

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:16.580
Huh?

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:23.200
I-I managed to put it on.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:24.620
How's the size?

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:27.200
Strangely enough, it fits perfectly.

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:31.330
Well, I did make it your size from the start!

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:35.580
Now that you've gotten
a sense of the fit, can I go?

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:39.120
Not yet. Today, I need you to
try on all of these outfits!

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:43.120
A-All of them?! I-Isn't that a little much?

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:48.330
Today is the only day I'll do this.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:50.540
Make sure to strike a cute pose, too, okay?

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:57.540
That's it. That's it, Shiina- <i>kun</i> .

00:19:57.540 --> 00:20:01.290
Perfect. That's good, too. Yes.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:05.250
Yes, that's it. That expression's perfect!

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:09.120
Mm, fantastic! How cute. Too cute.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:12.040
Good job! It's everything I expected!

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.200
Okay. Now for the last one!

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:17.370
Huh?

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:18.910
What?!

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:20.290
I can't!

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:22.540
Wait! You totally can! I promise!

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.200
There's no way! There's just no way!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.870
I'm telling you. Yuri!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.870
Come back here.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:32.040
Hey, stop! Hold on! It's too small!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:32.040
Shiina- <i>kun</i> , Shiina- <i>kun</i> . What's the big deal?

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.950
Why are you running away?

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.950
Is something wrong?

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.500
Are you all right?

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.250
Miss Caretaker?!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.910
This is terrible! I can't let her see me like this!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.370
Th-This is my only option!

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.660
Yuri!

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:49.580
I'm coming in.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:56.620
What's this?

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:03.910
Why are--

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:09.250
I imagined it, I suppose.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:19.200
Shiina- <i>kun</i> . You don't have
any thoughts about this situation?

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:20.290
Huh?

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:25.790
Oh, no, nyo, nyo! Oh, nyo!

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:36.700
She seems like a nice person, but still...

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:41.500
She certainly smelled nice...

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:50.700
He's such a goofball.

00:21:54.450 --> 00:22:00.450
I didn't get a picture with both of us,
but at least I have everyone now.

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:41.950
"Start of the Rainy Season, Wedding, Lap Pillow"
